@startuml economic_simulation_flow
title Economic Simulation — End-to-End Flow\n(Layered Architecture)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #555555
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E3
skinparam TitleFontSize 18

|#E8F1FA|Presentation|
start
:User submits **Variable + Delta**;
:Economic Simulation Interface;
-> EconomicChange;

|#E9F7EF|Application|
:Simulation Orchestrator
dispatches two tasks;

fork
  |#FEF5E7|Data / Infrastructure|
  :Retrieve stored
  **original 1-year result**;
  note right
    This layer also owns:
    * Economic Model Inputs
    * Variable Values
    * Model Configuration
  end note
  -> OriginalMetricResults;
fork again
  |#FDEDEC|Business Logic|
  :Economic Simulation Service
  applies the changed variable;
  :Ray Fair Model
  solves the changed scenario;
  -> ChangedMetricResults;
end fork

|#FDEDEC|Business Logic|
:Metric Comparison Service
----
* compare original vs changed
* identify metrics that changed
* compute delta per metric;
-> ChangedMetricsWithDeltas
(metric, original, changed, delta);

|#E9F7EF|Application|
:Orchestrator forwards deltas
via **LLM Integration**;

|#F4ECF7|LLM (external)|
:Interpret metric deltas
in economic terms;
-> EconomicInterpretation;

|#E9F7EF|Application|
:Assemble **SimulationResult**
----
* ChangedMetricResults
* metric deltas
* economic interpretation;
-> SimulationResult;

|#E8F1FA|Presentation|
:Format & display result;
stop
@enduml